Reference
.........
cdi:Agent

Definition
..........
Definition
==========
Something that bears some form of responsibility for an activity taking place, for the existence of an entity, or for another agent's activity. (See the W3C PROV-O ontology, https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-dm/#term-agent)


CDIF
----

Definition
..........
Abstract supertype for actors that can play roles on a dataset (creator, publisher, contributor, funder). Use Person or Organization as the concrete realisation.
</body>
