Reference
.........
geo:Geometry

Definition
..........
A coherent set of direct positions in space. The positions are held within a Spatial Reference System (SRS).

Scope
.....
Parent class(es): Spatial Object (http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#SpatialObject).


CDIF
----

